WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.616
Watch and read: We are performing a song about the rain. What is the best answer?

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:10.435
The answer is: Clap to the steady beat. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:10.435 --> 00:00:11.765
helpful or correct response.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:15.219
Watch and read: Which word rhymes with “cat”?

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:20.286
The answer is: hat. cat and hat have similar ending sounds.
